# Upload path

The flowchart above shows the upload path. The upload service hands each file to the virus scanner, and the scanner passes clean files to object storage.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  A[Upload service] --> B[Virus scanner] --> C[Object storage]
  B -->|rejects the file and notifies the uploader by email| D[Notification service]
```

Infected files go to the notification service, which emails the uploader about the rejected file.
